OL,3,AThe final minutes before floodwater
OL,4,Acrashed through Nepal-China border
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat happened in the minutes that
OL,7,Ffollowed is still difficult to
OL,8,Freconstruct. But fragments of video and
OL,9,Fsatellite imagery show much of the
OL,10,Fborder complex swept away, with
OL,11,Fbuildings that once crowded the valley
OL,12,Ffloor simply gone.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
